2|0@elderscrollsonline^1440710026#cuhx842:tuscanspeed$:Check your skill trees. Check the crafting skills. Look at the passives. Look at the first one or maybe 2 (I forget which the motif's chain off of, pretty sure it's the on that lets you access higher materials) &gt;Clothing (1/9) Allows the use of Cloth type [Jute, Flax, Cotton, Spidersilk, Ebonthread, Famin, Ironthread, Silverweave, Void Cloth] and Leather type [Rawhide, Leather, Thick Leather, Hide, Topgrain Hide, Fell Hide, Iron Hide, Scaled Hide, Daedra Hide]. That needs to be rank 8. So you'll need to invest skillpoints. I like constellations too. Kinda partial to Galaxy Class though.
